WEBVTT

00:01.126 --> 00:06.089
♪I'm not going to lose,
because I believe in myself♪

00:06.089 --> 00:10.886
♪I'll do whatever it takes
to protect that miracle♪

00:10.886 --> 00:20.687
(Even Given the Worthless "Appraiser" Class,
I'm Actually the Strongest)

00:20.687 --> 00:25.442
♪A fleeting dream I had is falling now♪

00:25.442 --> 00:29.321
♪The loneliness remains as my power♪

00:30.697 --> 00:34.618
♪To a life that is drifting away♪

00:34.618 --> 00:37.829
♪The magic sprinkles upon♪

00:39.248 --> 00:44.002
♪I pick up the fragments
and tightly tether them♪

00:44.002 --> 00:48.674
♪I always keep them as
my source of strength in my heart♪

00:48.674 --> 00:50.926
♪See the world through my eyes♪

00:50.926 --> 00:53.262
♪And you'll get your treasure♪

00:53.262 --> 00:58.767
♪Let's go around the world and find it out♪

00:59.977 --> 01:04.356
♪I'm not going to lose,
because I believe in myself♪

01:04.815 --> 01:09.486
♪Everything's possible
I've overcome a lot so far♪

01:09.486 --> 01:14.366
♪Because you have given it to me♪

01:14.366 --> 01:21.164
♪I'll do whatever it takes
to protect that miracle, for good♪

01:30.507 --> 01:33.510
Finally, we've become one, Nigun!

01:34.686 --> 01:37.764
That's not Nigun! Who are you?

01:37.764 --> 01:40.142
Allow me to properly introduce myself.

01:40.142 --> 01:43.895
I am a noble demon of the fifth rank,
Viscount Shadow of Illusions.

01:44.479 --> 01:48.025
Pleased to meet you, hero.

01:48.609 --> 01:51.653
Shadow of Illusions?
You are a demon?

01:51.653 --> 01:57.284
This bastard... It seems he was using
a concealment skill to deceive us.

01:57.284 --> 01:59.411
Where is Nigun, Shadow?

01:59.411 --> 02:03.915
Huh? He's exactly right
before your eyes!

02:03.915 --> 02:05.959
It's not my fault
he's such a weakling.

02:05.959 --> 02:11.048
Shook his mind a little,
and now his body is mine.

02:11.048 --> 02:14.051
He was so weak so I had it easy.

02:14.051 --> 02:15.552
Shadow...

02:15.552 --> 02:19.389
Oh, come on, Ein.
Stop acting like you're the victim.

02:19.389 --> 02:23.477
You are the reason
Nigun ended up like this.

02:23.477 --> 02:24.561
What?

02:24.561 --> 02:28.565
I weakened this territory's defense
by controlling him.

02:28.565 --> 02:33.195
Which helped me ship humans
to the Demon World rather smoothly.

02:33.195 --> 02:37.199
But you had to show up
and ruin everything.

02:37.712 --> 02:39.826
You left me with no choice.

02:39.826 --> 02:43.205
It's a hassle, but I'll just
have to kill you myself.

02:43.205 --> 02:48.210
I'm not some muscle-head
like Falco, though.

02:48.210 --> 02:51.672
I know exactly what makes
humans the weakest.

02:52.214 --> 02:57.928
As long as I'm in his body,
you have no way to stop me.

02:57.928 --> 03:02.975
Because if you kill me,
the vessel, Nigun, dies with me!

03:05.143 --> 03:06.478
I'll bind you up!

03:06.478 --> 03:07.854
Barrier!

03:07.854 --> 03:09.606
Pisses me off.

03:10.280 --> 03:11.858
Anti-Spirit Arts.

03:14.111 --> 03:17.072
We demons have Anti-Spirit Arts.

03:17.072 --> 03:20.117
That kind of spell won't work on me.

03:20.117 --> 03:25.622
Then I'll put more spirit energy into my
spells and overrun his Anti-Spirit Arts!

03:25.622 --> 03:28.375
Oh no, you don't.

03:32.212 --> 03:35.132
- What are these?!
- Stay away!

03:35.132 --> 03:37.134
Stop! Super Acceleration!

03:41.888 --> 03:44.641
It's dangerous here. Hurry, run!

03:44.641 --> 03:47.853
Are you really supposed
to ignore me now?

03:48.395 --> 03:51.398
Surely you don't want me to
summon more of them, right?

03:51.398 --> 03:53.150
This barrier...

03:53.734 --> 03:56.153
What if I get rid of this!

04:00.031 --> 04:01.533
Mirage Double!

04:03.034 --> 04:05.996
Are you all right?
I'll handle this.

04:05.996 --> 04:07.038
Hurry, evacuate!

04:10.542 --> 04:12.669
This is bad.
I need to create more clones...

04:12.670 --> 04:15.172
Worry about me too, will you?

04:15.172 --> 04:16.673
It gets lonely here.

04:19.760 --> 04:22.524
Helping people here and there...

04:22.525 --> 04:25.849
You sure have it rough,
Mister Ally of Justice!

04:25.849 --> 04:29.978
Damn it, I can't focus on
increasing my abilities' output!

04:29.978 --> 04:31.021
Parry!

04:32.814 --> 04:34.816
Immovable Fortress!

04:34.816 --> 04:37.778
That ability won't let you move, kid!

04:37.778 --> 04:40.155
Staying on the defensive
won't change a thing!

04:40.739 --> 04:43.158
I know that, but...

04:43.158 --> 04:46.511
Should I mix Yuri's purification
power into my attacks?

04:46.512 --> 04:50.916
But unless I extract Shadow
from Nigun, I'll end up hurting him...

04:50.916 --> 04:55.654
A stronger barrier
also won't hold him forever.

04:56.171 --> 04:58.673
What do I do? What should I do?!

04:59.174 --> 05:02.677
Come on, what's wrong?!
Aren't you going to fight back?!

05:02.677 --> 05:06.681
If you want to stop me,
you have to kill Nigun with me!

05:06.681 --> 05:10.894
Though, given how noble you are,
you can't. Can you, Mister Hero?

05:10.894 --> 05:14.689
As long as you stay naive about
saving both the villagers and Nigun,

05:14.689 --> 05:17.192
you're no better than a scarecrow!

05:17.465 --> 05:20.547
I really just don't get your logic.

05:20.548 --> 05:24.950
I mean, how could I?
By abandoning Nigun and killing me,

05:24.950 --> 05:28.453
you can save literally everyone else!

05:30.163 --> 05:30.956
That won't do.

05:31.456 --> 05:32.332
Huh?

05:33.041 --> 05:36.169
Abandon one to save a hundred?

05:36.169 --> 05:38.755
There's no way I can go with that plan!

05:39.548 --> 05:42.801
Nigun! I know you're still in there!

05:42.801 --> 05:45.011
Nigun!

05:46.429 --> 05:50.100
His mind is completely shut down, though.

05:50.100 --> 05:53.937
Yell as loud as you can
yet you will never reach him!

05:56.189 --> 05:58.942
Even so...
Even if that's the case...

06:00.110 --> 06:01.695
I can't abandon him!

06:02.112 --> 06:05.198
Call me naive, call me arrogant.

06:05.198 --> 06:07.784
Call me egoistic. I don't care!

06:08.451 --> 06:09.691
What's the deal with him?

06:09.692 --> 06:11.872
None of these hits
are stopping him at all!

06:11.872 --> 06:13.856
Damn it, just die already!

06:13.857 --> 06:14.836
Die!

06:14.837 --> 06:16.153
Don't overdo it, Ein.

06:16.154 --> 06:17.572
Please stop it!

06:17.573 --> 06:20.088
At this rate,
I won't be able to heal you, Ein...

06:28.015 --> 06:31.850
I will save both Nigun
and the villagers!

06:31.850 --> 06:33.602
That's why...

06:34.519 --> 06:36.605
I'm standing here!

06:49.117 --> 06:52.704
I want to disappear...
I just want to disappear.

06:52.704 --> 06:55.832
So many people have been
hurt because of me.

06:55.832 --> 06:59.377
A weak person like me
is better off gone. That way...

07:00.086 --> 07:02.672
No one will get hurt anymore...

07:03.882 --> 07:06.593
Nigun! Nigun!

07:07.302 --> 07:11.306
I can hear someone calling me.

07:11.306 --> 07:13.058
But I'm no longer...

07:13.767 --> 07:16.394
Nigun! Don't look away!

07:16.394 --> 07:20.273
You told me that you wanted
to protect Rayshik, remember?

07:20.273 --> 07:22.651
I can tell that's how you really feel.

07:22.651 --> 07:25.570
You must have your own
reason to protect Rayshik.

07:25.570 --> 07:30.033
Remember that! Open your eyes
and see it for yourself!

07:30.784 --> 07:34.037
What's my reason to protect Rayshik?

07:35.372 --> 07:39.125
Was it because I wanted
to be like my father?

07:39.125 --> 07:42.128
No, that's not all.

07:42.629 --> 07:45.382
My father was loved by everyone.

07:45.382 --> 07:50.303
Lots of people always
gather around him, smiling.

07:51.429 --> 07:56.351
That's it. Their smiles are my reason.

07:57.811 --> 08:00.397
You are very kind, Nigun.

08:00.397 --> 08:03.566
Never forget that kind heart of yours.

08:03.566 --> 08:06.736
If you do, one day,
you'll surely become a great lord.

08:08.989 --> 08:14.411
It's because I cherish that
moment and that place...

08:18.123 --> 08:20.125
Help! Help me!

08:21.543 --> 08:25.505
Stay calm, everyone! Their eyes
are their weakness! Aim for them!

08:25.505 --> 08:28.133
T-Thanks for saving me.

08:28.133 --> 08:32.470
Looks like Nigun is being
controlled by Shadow, a demon.

08:32.470 --> 08:33.680
We have to save him!

08:33.680 --> 08:34.681
Are you serious?

08:34.681 --> 08:36.975
He has made us suffer.

08:36.975 --> 08:41.020
Even so, we can't just put the blame
and run away anymore.

08:41.020 --> 08:42.897
We've decided to fight, remember?

08:42.897 --> 08:47.027
First, we save him!
We'll think about the rest later!

08:49.029 --> 08:50.739
Yeah, let's save him!

08:50.739 --> 08:53.533
To arms! We fight!

08:54.409 --> 08:57.037
What I did is unforgivable.

08:58.038 --> 09:03.043
I only believed what I wanted to
believe and ignored everything else.

09:03.752 --> 09:08.798
I should have known what
Shadow was doing behind my back!

09:09.965 --> 09:13.552
Admitting the truth is painful.
However...

09:13.553 --> 09:16.264
Unless I do that, I won't move forward!

09:17.057 --> 09:18.808
Open your eyes!

09:18.808 --> 09:20.351
Move forward!

09:27.531 --> 09:31.471
Fulfill your duty as the lord of Rayshik!

09:38.912 --> 09:40.205
Damn it!

09:40.723 --> 09:44.124
Can you not be so reckless, Ein?

09:44.125 --> 09:47.962
We're just hurting each other like this.

09:47.962 --> 09:51.591
It's not like you can kill me anyway.

09:52.342 --> 09:53.968
So just sit tight and let me—

09:54.511 --> 09:56.596
Huh? What?

09:56.596 --> 09:58.723
M-My body...

09:58.723 --> 10:02.894
Nigun! Stop putting up
a useless resistance!

10:02.894 --> 10:06.523
Whatever you do, I'm not leaving!

10:06.523 --> 10:09.109
Is that so?
Glad to hear, then.

10:11.125 --> 10:12.278
Sir Ein.

10:14.864 --> 10:16.241
Thank you.

10:21.496 --> 10:22.747
Nigun!

10:27.502 --> 10:28.336
Nigun!

10:28.336 --> 10:31.714
Hold it, Ein! Are you trying to
waste his resolve?!

10:35.607 --> 10:39.264
Nigun, you bastard!
Are you trying to get yourself killed?

10:40.306 --> 10:41.349
Shadow.

10:41.349 --> 10:46.020
I already knew deep down
that you weren't just an illusion.

10:46.020 --> 10:49.107
I knew, but I pretended not to see.

10:49.107 --> 10:51.401
We were friends, after all.

10:51.401 --> 10:56.865
You've betrayed me, used me,
and hurt so many people.

10:58.491 --> 11:01.286
But, even so...
Even now...

11:01.828 --> 11:05.874
I still think of you as my friend.

11:07.000 --> 11:09.752
Just live as yourself,
however you want.

11:10.461 --> 11:13.798
Perhaps you've said
nothing but lies to me.

11:14.340 --> 11:15.366
However...

11:16.593 --> 11:20.054
You really did save me back then.

11:21.306 --> 11:26.561
The time I spent with you was real.

11:29.606 --> 11:31.065
Nigun...

11:32.810 --> 11:34.927
To me you were...

11:36.487 --> 11:40.270
Nothing but a mere pawn
I could use, you dingus!

11:41.326 --> 11:44.370
Really, you're such a hopeless softie.

11:44.370 --> 11:47.373
Just looking at you pisses me off.

11:47.373 --> 11:53.004
Weakness is a sin.
The weak, by nature, invites plunder.

11:54.005 --> 11:58.009
They are used, stolen from,
and eventually, devoured.

11:58.009 --> 12:00.011
It's the natural order of things.

12:00.011 --> 12:04.457
I'm done playing your dumb
little friendship game.

12:05.016 --> 12:07.293
If you wanna die, then die alone.

12:20.156 --> 12:22.934
I should fall back
then regroup, for now.

12:26.537 --> 12:29.135
Maybe I should take over
that brat next.

12:29.136 --> 12:32.543
Just you wait, Ein.
I'll get you one day—

12:36.756 --> 12:37.824
Nigun!

12:40.301 --> 12:43.554
It's okay now.
I'll heal you right away.

12:43.554 --> 12:48.434
Yuri's healing magic is amazing.
She can heal any injury instantly.

12:49.310 --> 12:51.312
I will get you healed!

12:52.063 --> 12:54.941
So, please...
Don't die, Nigun!

12:59.237 --> 13:00.363
No way...

13:01.823 --> 13:03.992
Not yet, Ein!

13:04.826 --> 13:08.121
Our feelings will reach him!

13:08.121 --> 13:11.207
Nigun will come back to us!

13:11.207 --> 13:12.166
Yuri...

13:13.334 --> 13:15.086
You're right!

13:15.086 --> 13:18.339
He won't die. I won't let him die!

13:18.339 --> 13:21.009
Nigun! Please come back to us!

13:21.009 --> 13:22.593
This is where you belong!

13:22.593 --> 13:24.095
Right here!

13:31.390 --> 13:32.641
Father?

13:41.012 --> 13:42.363
Come back, Nigun!

13:42.363 --> 13:43.489
Nigun!

13:47.660 --> 13:50.496
Huh? Why am I...

13:50.496 --> 13:52.665
Wasn't I supposed to be dead?

13:52.665 --> 13:55.585
I'm glad you're back, Nigun!

13:55.585 --> 13:58.296
Nigun! That's great, I'm so glad.

13:59.505 --> 14:01.507
But... why?

14:01.507 --> 14:03.259
Why did you save me?!

14:03.800 --> 14:06.761
I... I was supposed to die!

14:06.763 --> 14:11.100
I can only atone by sacrificing
my own life, and yet...

14:11.100 --> 14:12.268
Nigun!

14:12.935 --> 14:17.940
You said that if sacrificing a soul can
save a hundred more, then so be it.

14:18.524 --> 14:22.111
But I don't want to leave,
not even a single soul.

14:22.111 --> 14:25.031
And that includes you, Nigun.

14:25.031 --> 14:26.908
I won't abandon you!

14:26.908 --> 14:29.118
Sir Ein...

14:29.118 --> 14:30.328
He's right.

14:31.537 --> 14:35.917
If we abandon you here,
then we'd be no different.

14:35.917 --> 14:37.043
Besides...

14:37.043 --> 14:40.296
Never think that your death
will be enough to atone your sins.

14:40.296 --> 14:43.800
What you did is honestly unforgivable.
I resent that, even.

14:43.800 --> 14:45.051
However...

14:45.051 --> 14:48.262
Your death won't revive
the villagers that you sacrificed.

14:48.262 --> 14:52.308
They can't punish you
nor liberate you from your sins!

14:53.059 --> 14:57.021
So we can't let you die that easily.

14:57.021 --> 14:59.732
Take responsibility
for what you've done to us.

14:59.732 --> 15:01.692
Face our anger and atone for those!

15:01.692 --> 15:03.820
Don't you dare run away, Nigun!

15:07.824 --> 15:10.827
I can't believe I'm so naive.

15:12.328 --> 15:15.289
Thinking that my death would
make up for everything...

15:15.289 --> 15:18.084
Thinking that I can just go
to my father's side...

15:18.084 --> 15:19.961
When a person like me...

15:20.837 --> 15:25.007
...should only be thankful to all of you
for giving me another chance.

15:25.007 --> 15:26.717
Thank you so much!

15:29.136 --> 15:31.347
I'm so glad for you, Nigun...

15:31.347 --> 15:32.765
Yuri!

15:32.765 --> 15:34.851
I'm fine...

15:36.144 --> 15:39.939
I'm just a little bit exhausted.

15:41.777 --> 15:44.279
She had been exerting
herself so much...

15:46.320 --> 15:48.072
Thank you, Yuri.

15:50.116 --> 15:53.061
Had I met Shadow first,

15:53.661 --> 15:55.830
I probably would've ended up like Nigun.

15:56.622 --> 15:58.291
Ein...

16:04.088 --> 16:07.592
Can't the weak live at all?

16:07.592 --> 16:10.386
Is being weak that heavy a sin?

16:10.887 --> 16:14.098
Nigun wasn't the only one.
Zoid was also the same.

16:14.891 --> 16:16.142
I...

16:17.018 --> 16:22.023
I won't forgive demons that
prey on people's weakness.

16:22.023 --> 16:23.274
I won't forgive them!

16:28.946 --> 16:32.033
Are you sure you're all right, Yuri?

16:32.033 --> 16:35.953
Big Sis Yuri really overdid herself.

16:35.953 --> 16:36.704
Pina!

16:37.413 --> 16:39.290
What is it, Big Sis Alice?

16:41.042 --> 16:46.631
As if I'd let myself die here.
Dammit! Damn it all!

16:46.631 --> 16:47.757
Barrier!

16:48.299 --> 16:50.301
Where do you think you're going?

16:50.301 --> 16:54.805
Well, somewhere less
troublesome, I guess?

16:55.218 --> 16:57.140
What's going on, Alice, Pina?

16:57.141 --> 16:59.310
This thing is trying to make an escape!

16:59.310 --> 17:01.938
It's dangerous.
Both of you, get behind me.

17:05.233 --> 17:07.902
I have some questions for you, demon.

17:07.902 --> 17:11.572
Why do you want to kill me?
What's the demons' goal?

17:12.337 --> 17:15.326
As if I'd tell you even if I knew.

17:15.326 --> 17:17.870
I see. Then I'll erase you
without a trace.

17:17.870 --> 17:19.580
Wait, wait, calm down!

17:19.580 --> 17:23.334
I'll tell you if you promise to let me go.

17:23.834 --> 17:25.294
Fine.

17:25.294 --> 17:26.879
Ein, you...

17:26.879 --> 17:27.630
It's okay.

17:30.466 --> 17:33.344
There's an order out to kill you.

17:33.344 --> 17:36.097
An order? From who?

17:36.100 --> 17:37.790
It's from...

17:40.101 --> 17:45.481
Looks like a spell was cast to activate
when internal matters are spoken of.

17:45.481 --> 17:47.608
A cautious opponent, indeed.

17:54.824 --> 17:56.742
Is that demon dead?

17:56.742 --> 17:58.995
Yes, it's safe now.

18:00.371 --> 18:04.375
Thank you. Because of you,
we can move forward.

18:04.375 --> 18:05.835
Thank you, Hero.

18:05.836 --> 18:07.628
You really saved us!

18:07.628 --> 18:11.882
Dear God, are you leaving?
Will we never get to see you again?

18:13.009 --> 18:16.304
That's not true.
I'll definitely come back.

18:16.304 --> 18:17.388
I promise!

18:19.390 --> 18:21.892
Okay! It's a promise!

18:23.728 --> 18:24.895
Sir Ein.

18:25.438 --> 18:28.024
I can never thank you enough.

18:28.024 --> 18:29.400
Nigun...

18:29.400 --> 18:33.613
I know I have no right to ask for this,
but indulge me just this once.

18:33.613 --> 18:37.408
Allow me to make one last request.

18:37.908 --> 18:38.909
A request?

18:39.910 --> 18:44.665
I would like you to continue
supporting Rayshik however possible.

18:45.666 --> 18:50.671
As you know, Rayshik is a frequent
target for monster attacks.

18:51.339 --> 18:54.809
Simply having a demon slayer
like you as our protector

18:54.810 --> 18:57.219
will be enough to deter them.

18:57.219 --> 18:58.679
So please...

18:58.679 --> 19:00.306
I beg you!

19:02.525 --> 19:07.014
We intend to fight back as well,
but having you here will encourage us.

19:07.021 --> 19:09.607
We beg you, on behalf of all of us.

19:10.191 --> 19:11.817
Please!

19:18.532 --> 19:19.283
What?

19:19.283 --> 19:22.787
Me? Becoming the lord of Rayshik?!

19:22.787 --> 19:28.959
Indeed. I want to grant you a noble title
for slaying those demons.

19:28.959 --> 19:33.547
Nigun himself has requested to transfer
the ownership of his land to you.

19:33.547 --> 19:36.550
He also turned himself in willingly.

19:36.550 --> 19:40.054
He wishes to formally receive
judgment and atone for his sins...

19:40.054 --> 19:43.057
...before helping to rebuild Rayshik.

19:43.057 --> 19:45.601
You quelled the chaos in the capital,

19:45.601 --> 19:49.438
unveiled the darkness in Rayshik,
and defeated the demons

19:49.438 --> 19:53.085
Such a great deed
must be rewarded fairly,

19:53.086 --> 19:55.945
lest it tarnish
the royal family's prestige.

19:55.945 --> 20:01.200
Thus, I intend to grant you the territory
I had previously bestowed upon Nigun.

20:01.790 --> 20:03.933
Once you become a noble, young man,

20:03.934 --> 20:06.455
you will receive both
a title and a surname.

20:06.455 --> 20:09.770
Ein Rayshik will be your full name now.

20:09.771 --> 20:14.839
Is that so? Still, a low-ranked
appraiser becoming a noble is rather...

20:14.839 --> 20:17.925
Of course there was much opposition,

20:17.925 --> 20:21.846
but that's why I tasked you
with slaying the demons.

20:21.846 --> 20:23.597
Rubby rub.

20:24.196 --> 20:27.442
You accomplished the incredible
feat of vanquishing demons!

20:27.443 --> 20:29.729
No one can object now!

20:30.604 --> 20:35.359
Once you become a noble, the
Adventurers' Guild will fully back you up.

20:36.277 --> 20:39.113
This is all happening so fast.
I can't keep up.

20:39.113 --> 20:41.031
No need to overthink it.

20:42.366 --> 20:45.703
Just prioritize your goals.

20:45.703 --> 20:48.873
I will handle the noble duties for you.

20:48.873 --> 20:53.294
Plus, becoming a noble will give you
connections with influential people.

20:53.294 --> 20:56.881
Making it easier to gain
information on hidden dungeons.

20:59.508 --> 21:03.721
I had planned to support
the Rayshik territory anyway.

21:03.721 --> 21:07.600
Though, I didn't expect to
receive a noble title as well.

21:14.148 --> 21:15.274
Very well.

21:15.816 --> 21:19.028
I humbly accept this honor.

21:21.780 --> 21:23.660
Oh, my hero!

21:25.868 --> 21:30.414
With this, our marriage is
starting to feel much more real!

21:30.414 --> 21:34.919
Indeed. This at least puts you
on the starting line to make it official.

21:34.919 --> 21:39.256
Why does it feel like
they're closing in around me?

21:39.256 --> 21:41.175
That's unfair!

21:42.009 --> 21:43.851
I'll marry him too!

21:43.852 --> 21:44.720
Yuri?!

21:44.720 --> 21:47.681
Of course!
Yuri is the first wife, after all.

21:49.975 --> 21:55.105
Oh my, looks like you have
a lot of rivals, Big Sis Alice.

21:56.565 --> 22:01.237
By the way, you are currently
the fourth candidate.

22:01.237 --> 22:02.363
The fourth?

22:09.620 --> 22:14.959
♪No matter what trials you face,
no reason to be in such a hurry♪

22:14.959 --> 22:19.964
♪The wind will never stop carrying on,
as long as you have faith in yourself♪

22:19.964 --> 22:22.383
♪Never give up, the future's just ahead♪

22:22.383 --> 22:25.469
♪Just like rock music that will never die♪

22:28.472 --> 22:30.432
♪Keep on, keep on strumming!♪

22:32.434 --> 22:37.189
♪There are only pointless things
I have to do on my list♪

22:37.189 --> 22:42.069
♪Even the sun of my burning heart
has now completely sank♪

22:42.069 --> 22:47.074
♪I have completely lost track
of my whereabouts♪

22:47.074 --> 22:51.871
♪I wonder where it goes
The very thing I once cherished♪

22:53.163 --> 22:55.624
♪I drowned in hustle and bustle♪

22:55.624 --> 22:57.084
♪In the midst of loneliness♪

22:57.084 --> 23:03.966
♪Every person is being
made aware of reality♪

23:05.843 --> 23:11.265
♪As I was reaching the out of reach
I wasn't sure if I saw a mirage♪

23:11.265 --> 23:15.936
♪As long as you have faith in yourself
The future is possible for you to change♪

23:15.936 --> 23:18.606
♪Even if rocks get in your way forward♪

23:18.606 --> 23:21.191
♪You must stick to your will
and see it through♪

23:21.191 --> 23:26.113
♪Even if, the worst, everything fails
There will definitely be another chance♪

23:26.113 --> 23:28.532
♪The only one to rival is yourself♪

23:28.532 --> 23:31.076
♪Always set your sights
on to rock 'n' goal!♪

23:31.076 --> 23:31.702
(Even Given)

23:31.702 --> 23:32.286
(the Worthless "Appraiser" Class,)

23:32.286 --> 23:32.494
(I'm)

23:32.494 --> 23:32.661
(Actually)

23:32.661 --> 23:32.786
(the Strongest)

23:35.831 --> 23:38.417
Next episode: Demon Ioana.

23:38.417 --> 23:39.980
(Next episode: Demon Ioana)
